must/have to kuchli zarurat; can ruxsat yoki imkoniyat. Bir shakl bir necha ma’no olishi mumkin, shuning uchun vaziyat muhim. Might/may ehtimol, must xulosa uchun ham ishlatiladi: She must be busy — dalilga tayangan taxmin, bu buyruq emas. Can’t deduction kuchli mumkin emas degan xulosa: That can’t be Ali; he is away. Mustn’t esa taqiq. Taxminni fakt sifatida sotmang.","hint":"must be busy / might arrive late / can’t be here / should ask","tokens":["You","should","ask","before","using","the","room."]},{"id":"en-b1-10-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Mustn’t ma’nosi?","answers":["prohibition"],"explanation":"Taqiq.","hint":"must be busy / might arrive late / can’t be here / should ask","options":["prohibition","uncertain possibility","optional activity"]},{"id":"en-b1-10-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We mustn’t share private photos."],"explanation":"Should maslahat; must/have to kuchli zarurat; can ruxsat yoki imkoniyat. Bir shakl bir necha ma’no olishi mumkin, shuning uchun vaziyat muhim. Might/may ehtimol, must xulosa uchun ham ishlatiladi: She must be busy — dalilga tayangan taxmin, bu buyruq emas. Can’t deduction kuchli mumkin emas degan xulosa: That can’t be Ali; he is away. Mustn’t esa taqiq. Taxminni fakt sifatida sotmang.","hint":"must be busy / might arrive late / can’t be here / should ask","tokens":["We","mustn’t","share","private","photos."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-b1-10","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","le